#: ../../source/start/install.md
msgid "`freeports`"
msgstr "`freeports`"

#: ../../source/start/install.md
msgid "the extraction engine: the `freeports` command and the Python module of the same name"
msgstr "o motor de extração: o comando `freeports` e o módulo Python de mesmo nome"

#: ../../source/start/install.md
msgid "everyone"
msgstr "todo mundo"

#: ../../source/start/install.md
msgid "`freeports-dev`"
msgstr "`freeports-dev`"

#: ../../source/start/install.md
msgid ""
"the `freeports-dev` command and a pytest plugin: inspecting pages, generating "
"fixtures, running a formats repository's tests"
msgstr ""
"o comando `freeports-dev` e um plugin de pytest: inspecionar páginas, gerar fixtures,"
